VESPA export hook for upstream SYMPOL (https://github.com/s-marton/SYMPOL, commit 4f24add, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2024 Sascha Marton). Apply with `git apply` inside a checkout of that commit.
The hook only writes the final actor of each trial (with its evaluation history and its outputs on a probe set) to
$SYMPOL_EXPORT_DIR after training. It does not touch training or any random number stream.

